WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.583 --> 00:00:03.086
This is the story of 
a very sick girl

00:00:03.086 --> 00:00:05.755
and a set of events seen 
two different ways.

00:00:07.757 --> 00:00:10.301
Justina, just a very 
special child.

00:00:10.301 --> 00:00:11.302
I love you!

00:00:11.302 --> 00:00:12.303
I love you too!

00:00:12.303 --> 00:00:13.096
She was thriving.

00:00:13.471 --> 00:00:16.016
About 10 years of age, 
things changed.

00:00:16.141 --> 00:00:17.517
She was in so much pain.

00:00:17.642 --> 00:00:20.353
The hospital was alleging 
the Pelletier family

00:00:20.353 --> 00:00:22.522
was overmedicalizing 
their daughter.

00:00:22.522 --> 00:00:25.358
Overmedicalizing is getting 
more medications or

00:00:25.358 --> 00:00:26.693
procedures than they need.

00:00:28.111 --> 00:00:30.238
Doctors are saying 
Justina's parents

00:00:30.238 --> 00:00:32.323
aren't making safe 
decisions for her.

00:00:32.449 --> 00:00:33.616
It just made no sense.

00:00:33.658 --> 00:00:35.368
The juvenile court decided

00:00:35.368 --> 00:00:37.245
to terminate the 
parents' custody.

00:00:37.412 --> 00:00:40.415
Linda and I never abused 
any of our children.

00:00:42.250 --> 00:00:44.294
Was Justina being abused?

00:00:44.294 --> 00:00:45.503
I don't understand it.

00:00:46.963 --> 00:00:50.216
Then something happens that changes everything.

00:00:50.592 --> 00:00:53.595
This very ominous video 
comes out from Anonymous.

00:00:53.720 --> 00:00:55.472
And that's when all 
hell broke loose.

